==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|рас-|плати́ть|-ся}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|расплати́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-расплатиться.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|расплати́ться|pf|impf=распла́чиваться}}

# to [[pay]] {{+obj|ru|:на(pre)<for something> + ins<with something>}}
# to [[pay off]] {{+obj|ru|:с(ins)<a debt, loan, etc.>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''расплати́ться''' [[с]] [[долг|долга́ми]]|to '''pay off''' one's [[debt]]s}}
# to [[get even]] with, to [[take revenge]] on {{+obj|ru|:с(ins)<someone>}}
# {{lb|ru|figurative}} to [[pay]] for, to [[receive]] [[punishment]] for {{+obj|ru|:за(acc)<a mistake, etc.>}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4c|расплати́ться}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|распла́та}}
